Yudhājit arrives from Ayōdhyā seeking sister's son --- Daśaratha honors guest and leads sons and seers to altar --- Rāma comes adorned with brothers at Vijaya muhūrta --- Vasiṣṭha asks Janaka to act as giver --- Janaka declares himself ready waiting at altar --- Janaka gives Sītā to Rāma and Ūrmilā to Lakṣmaṇa --- Janaka gives Māṇḍavī to Bharata and Śrutakīrti to Śatrughna --- Couples circumambulate fire and wed by rite --- Flowers rain while Apsarases dance and Gandharvas sing --- Newlyweds thrice circle fire and retire to lodging